# Disable PCSX2's FFmpeg-based video/audio capture, the only user of FFmpeg.
# GSCapture becomes a no-op stub, the FFmpeg lookup is dropped from CMake, and
# the capture menu entry, settings tab, OSD status and recording folder are
# removed. Targets the 2.8.x stable branch.

